  "title": "CamoShift Breaks Cross-Modal Fusion and Enhances Visual Stealth in Infrared Detection",
  "summary": "CamoShift, an adversarial framework, combines object-level infrared camouflage with spatial decoupling to disrupt cross-modal fusion and enhance visual stealth. The Semantic Camouflage Module (SCM) and Object-level Spatial Decoupling Module (OSDM) work together to break alignment and fusion, while the Harmonic Adversarial loss optimizes both attack effectiveness and visual stealth.",
